OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust joins Alzheimer's
OL,4,Aprevention drug trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlzheimer's disease is the most common
OL,7,Fform of dementia and accounts for 60%
OL,8,Fto 80% of the country's dementia cases,
OL,9,Faccording to the NHS.
